  "note": "[N] nasqret/z-in-q-lean, a definition, through its dependency: [N] has no own definition of point references, generator constraints or model recipes, and no [N] declaration uses ndep's pointRef, generatorConstraints, Pstar or specPstar; ndep's copies, identical in these files to [F]'s, agree on the references and generator equations but build P_* in Lean instead of from the bytes and only bound the witness count by 292890231904. [N]'s saved_root records the exact count 292890231904 as decoded data, and ndep's Pstar uses the A+e pole template, a difference outside this passage.",
